Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:14.67,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,繼承的意志...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.67,0:00:17.58,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,時代的浪潮，\N人們的夢想...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:20.41,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,這些都是無法阻止的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.41,0:00:23.52,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,只要人們繼續追求自由，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:26.15,RogerMonologue,,0,0,0,,這些就永遠不會停歇。
